<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Filemona</book>
  <para style="h">Filemona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filemona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemona</para>
  <para style="mt">Filemona</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Krista Isua avânga tâng leh kan unaupa Timothean kan thawhpui duh tak Filemona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kan farnu Afii te, kan sipaipui Arkipa te leh i ina inkhâwm ṭhîn kohhran mîte chibai kan bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Pa Pathian leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna te, remna te in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ṭawngṭainaah te ka hre reng ṭhîn che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I rinna thu leh Lalpa Isua leh mi thianghlimte i hmangaihzia ka hriatin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rinna avânga inpâwlhona kan neih tâkna hian Kristaah chuan malsâwmna tinrêng kan dawnte hriatthiamna a tihthûk zual zêl ka beisei e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Unaupa, i hmangaihna thu ka hriatin ka lâwm êm êm a, mi thianghlimte thinlung pawh i chawh phûr thar tâk avângin ka thla a muang ta huai mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hei vâng tak hian Kristaa unau kan nihnaah i tih âwm ti tûrin thu pe ngam che mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />i hmangaihna hriain, kei putar Paula, tûna Krista Isua vânga mi tâng hian, a ngenin ka ngên zâwk dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka fapa Onesima, tân ina ka hrin tân hian ka ngên che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûn hma khân i tân hman tlâk loh ni ṭhîn mah se, tûnah zawng ka tân a ṭangkai a, i tân pawh a ṭangkai tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka duhsakna thinlung zawng zawng nên i hnênah hei ka han tîr kîr e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha avânga ka tân chhûng hian i aia min pui tûrin awmpui zêl ka duh hle a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mahse, rem i tih loh zâwng eng mah tih ka duh lo; min hmangaihna chu nangmah aṭanga puak chhuak ngei ni se ka duh avângin ani hi hrên luihsak che ka duh lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eng emaw chhûng a tlân bosan che hi kumkhuaa i hnêna a ngam hlen tawhna ai a ni ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tûnah zawng, bawih ang ni tawh lovin, bawih aia hlu tak, unau duh tak a ni tawh e; ka tân a duhawm êm êm a, i tân pawh tisa lamah leh Lalpaah a duhawm lehzual ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, i thawhpui nia mi ngaih takmeuh chuan keimah ang maiin ani hi lo lâwm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I lakah tihdik loh emaw, bat emaw a neih chuan ka rulh atân lo dah la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei, Paula hian keima kut ngeia ziakin ka rûl ang ka tih hi, nangmah ngei ka hnênah i inbat ve thu sawi tum phei zawng ka ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, unaupa, Lalpa avângin he thil hi min tihsak la, Kristaah chuan ka thinlung tilâwm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ngenna che hi a hlawhtlin ngei beisei tlatin ka ziak a nih hi, ka beisei aia nasa mahin i tih ka ring nghe nghe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In ṭawngṭainate chu chhân a niha, in hnêna lo chhuah ka inbeisei a, thlenna tûr in mi lo ngaihtuahsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Epafra, Krista Isuaa ka tânpui hian chibai a bûk a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka thawhpui Marka te, Aristarka te, Dema te leh Luka te hian chibai an bûk a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu in zaa hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
